Social Network Friend Recommendations
Description
Social Network Friend Recommendations
Scenario: You're building a simple social network where users can be friends. Friendships are mutual (undirected) and have no weights.

Your Tasks:
Create a social network with 6 users (0-5)

Add friendships: 0-1, 0-2, 1-3, 2-3, 2-4, 3-5, 4-5

Find all friends of user 2

Check if user 0 and user 5 are connected (directly or indirectly)

Find the shortest path (in terms of number of friends) between user 0 and user 5

Find all users who are at distance 2 from user 1

Detect if there's a cycle in the network

Find all connected components (friend groups)




